WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.954
Hi, I'm Nkechinyere.

2
00:00:02.104 --> 00:00:05.865
I'll guide you through setting up your Scholastiar profile.

3
00:00:06.415 --> 00:00:13.254
It's a short interview — 8 steps, about 13 minutes — and you only do it once.

4
00:00:13.404 --> 00:00:15.627
Everything saves as you go.

5
00:00:16.177 --> 00:00:18.785
Please take your time with it:

6
00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:23.850
your answers become your CV, your application drafts and your visa guidance.

7
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.915
The more complete and honest you are, the stronger every application gets.
